<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Franki wins two bln bfr contracts.</title>
<headline>Belgian Franki wins two bln bfr contracts.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian construction group Franki said on Friday its  Foraky unit had won contracts worth two billion francs ($65 million) in El Salvador.  </p>
<p>The work -- geothermal drilling at Berlin in the east of El Salvador and Ahuachapan in the west -- will be carried out by Foraky unit  Forasol. The two-year project involving four drilling rigs starts in March 1997.</p>
<p>The contracts are part of a $200 million project to increase the geothermal production of electricity.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
